CONTEXT Visits IN ENGLISH
-- An existing system with a concept Session. Its name differs from SESSION, which every application has,
-- only in case, so compiled by itself its table gets a disambiguated name.

RELATION visitor[Session*Person] [UNI]
-- A relation on SESSION, the concept that every application has. Compiled by itself, the system
-- stores it as a column in its own table SESSION.
RELATION currentVisit[SESSION*Session] [UNI]

POPULATION visitor CONTAINS [ ("s1", "Ann") ]

ENDCONTEXT
